// Debian's security updates only, each morning (hosts/pbs/README.md → Updates).
// PBS's own packages and Debian's point releases come with `apt full-upgrade`, which setup.sh runs.
// No reboot here: the agent reboots PBS at night when /run/reboot-required says it needs one.
#clear Unattended-Upgrade::Origins-Pattern;
Unattended-Upgrade::Origins-Pattern {
  "origin=Debian,codename=${distro_codename}-security,label=Debian-Security";
};
